ForgeCAD FPS Production Foundation 0.1.0-proposal

This evaluation-only package contains selected byte-identical CC0 assets from
Kenney Blaster Kit 2.1, Quaternius Sci-Fi Modular Gun Pack, Pichuliru CC0 Flat
Guns and Attachments, Lightning Pump Action Rifle, and WRAD ARMS. Source URLs,
frozen revisions or archive hashes, per-file hashes, license evidence and
intended roles are recorded in manifest.json and the adoption receipts.

The assets are admitted only as offline references for semantic part naming,
socket vocabulary, rig mapping, blockout variation and High-Low-PBR readback
benchmarking. They are not active Runtime geometry or a confirmed candidate.
The Lightning source provides external High/Low/bake evidence and an admitted
baked Low GLB, but it does not prove ForgeCAD-owned editable High-Low, Cage,
UV, bake, complete FPS animation, engine or commercial Hero quality.

ForgeCAD uses them only for legal, nonfunctional fictional game, film and
visualization assets. No manufacturing dimensions, functional construction or
performance guidance are included.
